                "text": "Vulnerabilities that allow attackers to inject client-side scripts"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "**Cross-Site Scripting (XSS)**\n\nVulnerabilities that allow attackers to inject client-side scripts\n\n**Impact (type metadata)**\nCan lead to session hijacking, credential theft, or delivery of malware to users\n\n**Mitigation (type metadata)**\nApply context-aware output encoding, use Content-Security-Policy, validate and sanitize all inputs"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/psyray/oasis"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "results": [
