          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Vulnerability\n\nUsing msg.sender.call.value() with a user-input variable _weiToWithdraw allows an attacker to inject malicious JavaScript code.\n\nImpact: An attacker could steal sensitive data or perform unauthorized actions on behalf of the user.\n\nRemediation: Use msg.sender.call.value(_weiToWithdraw, 'approved') instead of msg.sender.call.value(_weiToWithdraw)."
          },
